@gaby 
The RFC of the `Origin` header ([RFC 6454: The Web Origin Concept](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6454#section-7)) does not restrict the protocol (scheme).

The CORS protocol, in general, is not defined in an RFC but in the W3C recommendation titled ["Fetch standard" under 3.2](https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cors-protocol). This one also doesn't restrict the protocol.
